Arkansas is a leader in aquaculture, so I proudly champion policies to help maintain and enhance that status. Enjoyed visiting with catfish farmers and researchers at @UAPBinfo with Gov. @SarahHuckabee and getting a firsthand update.

@SenateAgGOP and @SenateGOP secured ELAP improvements in the Working Families @TaxCuts that are supporting our farmers dealing with bird depredation as well as investing in more research. Now we're following that up by bolstering 1890 land-grand institutions in Farm Bill 2.0 to allow schools like UAPB to continue promoting quality research-based learning right here in Pine Bluff.

Increasing access to markets and making sure Arkansans have access to the catfish grown in our state continues to be one of my priorities.
